<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Notícias Educativas | Portal de Atividades</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #6366f1;
            --primary-dark: #4f46e5;
            --bg: #f8fafc;
        }

        .news-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-dark));
            color: white;
            padding: 4rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 0 0 30px 30px;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .news-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 1.5rem 4rem;
        }

        .news-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .news-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
        }

        .news-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .news-body {
            padding: 1.5rem;
            flex-grow: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .news-tag {
            background: #eef2ff;
            color: var(--primary);
            padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .news-title {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1e293b;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .news-summary {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .news-footer {
            margin-top: auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding-top: 1rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
        }

        .read-more {
            color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .news-date {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .news-header { padding: 3rem 1rem; }
            .news-grid { gap: 1.5rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body style="background: var(--bg);">

    <nav class="main-nav">
        <div class="nav-container">
            <a href="/" class="logo">
                <i class="fas fa-graduation-cap"></i> Portal
            </a>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="/">Home</a>
                <a href="/noticias" class="active">Blog</a>
                <a href="/professor/login" class="btn-login">Área do Prof</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <header class="news-header">
        <h1>Notícias e Novidades</h1>
        <p>Tudo o que acontece no mundo da educação e as novidades do nosso portal.</p>
    </header>

    <main class="news-grid">
        <% if (news.length === 0) { %>
            <div style="grid-column: 1/-1; text-align: center; padding: 4rem; color: #64748b;">
                <i class="fas fa-newspaper fa-4x" style="margin-bottom: 1rem; opacity: 0.3;"></i>
                <p>Nenhuma notícia publicada ainda.</p>
            </div>
        <% } %>

        <% news.forEach(article => { %>
            <article class="news-card">
                <img src="<%= article.image_url || 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503676260728-1c00da094a0b?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=800' %>" alt="<%= article.title %>" class="news-image">
                <div class="news-body">
                    <div>
                        <span class="news-tag"><%= article.category %></span>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="news-title"><%= article.title %></h2>
                    <p class="news-summary"><%= article.summary %></p>
                    <div class="news-footer">
                        <span class="news-date">
                            <i class="far fa-calendar-alt"></i> 
                            <%= new Date(article.created_at).toLocaleDateString('pt-BR') %>
                        </span>
                        <a href="/noticia/<%= article.id %>" class="read-more">
                            Ler mais <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
        <% }); %>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer">
        <p>&copy; 2024 Portal de Atividades. Criado para transformar a educação.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
